 (!> huginn  >  help                            host huginn · core 2.3.0 · live
                                                                               
  keys                                                                         
   up/dn j k   move                                                            
   enter       open, or attach to a session                                    
   esc         back                                                            
   1-9         jump to a section                                               
   r           refresh now                                                     
   q           quit                                                            
                                                                               
  states                                                                       
   * working                                                                   
   ! needs you                                                                 
   o waiting                                                                   
   - shell                                                                     
   + ok                                                                        
   x error                                                                     
                                                                               
  Each screen names its one-shot command at the bottom; huginn help lists all. 
  Plain huginn opens this console. HUGINN_CONSOLE=0 attaches to main instead.  
  In a session, Ctrl-b d detaches and brings you back here.                    
                                                                               
 esc back  ? help  q quit                                                      
 same as: huginn help                                                          